  ✅ Live monitor checked — 3 HIGH-risk events in last hour
  ✅ RE-1002 investigated — USA 310-260 impossible travel + fraud signals
  ✅ Anomaly engine confirmed 3 critical/high detections (z-score statistical model)
  ✅ CSV batch (342 CDRs) analysed instantly — 11 anomalies surfaced
